# Product-only file path (do not commit this example as kit-baseline in the kit repo):
#   docs/product/kit-baseline
#
# One line: full SHA of the last-merged kit tip (upstream/main after merge).
# Used by kit .github/workflows/ci.yml on product Actions to set ZERO_EDIT_BASE_REF
# (no upstream remote on checkout). See docs/kit/product-consumer-contract.md § CI zero-edit base.
#
# Update after every: git fetch upstream && git merge upstream/main
#   git rev-parse upstream/main > docs/product/kit-baseline
#
REPLACE_WITH_FULL_KIT_TIP_SHA
